<title>SOUTH KOREA: Daelim delays cracker maintenance.</title>
<headline>Daelim delays cracker maintenance.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's Daelim Industrial Co Ltd said on Monday it had postponed the period for its annual maintenance shutdown of its 300,000 tonnes a year naphtha cracker to October 14-November 18.</p>
<p>Daelim, which gave no reason for the postponement, had originally planned to conduct maintenance from Monday to November 10.</p>
<p>Daelim has a naphtha cracking capability of 700,000 tonnes a year.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727 5643</p>
